321" end="0:15.950">号</span></p><p begin="0:15.950" end="0:21.747" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.950" end="0:16.216">Yes</span> <span begin="0:16.338" end="0:16.800">ok</span> <span begin="0:16.800" end="0:17.039">yo</span> <span begin="0:17.899" end="0:18.528">是你让</span><span begin="0:18.528" end="0:19.169">星光</span><span begin="0:19.169" end="0:19.650">在</span><span begin="0:19.650" end="0:20.829">我指尖舞</span><span begin="0:20.829" end="0:21.747">蹈</span></p><p begin="0:22.013" end="0:24.703" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:22.013" end="0:22.402">从那</span><span begin="0:22.402" end="0:22.883">天</span> <span begin="0:23.083" end="0:23.553">初</span><span begin="0:23.753" end="0:24.204">次</span><span begin="0:24.204" end="0:24.400">遇</span><span begin="0:24.400" end="0:24.703">见</span></p><p begin="0:24.832" end="0:27.618" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:24.832" end="0:25.189">到后</span><span begin="0:25.189" end="0:25.621">来</span> <span begin="0:25.871" end="0:26.352">青</span><span begin="0:26.541" end="0:26.950">春</span><span begin="0:26.950" end="0:27.510">每一</span><span begin="0:27.510" end="0:27.618">页</span></p><p begin="0:26.879" end="0:32.624" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:26.879" end="0:27.917">这段记</span><span begin="0:27.917" end="0:28.973">忆</span> <span begin="0:28.973" end="0:29.262">是</span><span begin="0:29.262" end="0:29.430">夹</span><span begin="0:29.430" end="0:29.830">在</span><span begin="0:29.830" end="0:29.948">故</span><span begin="0:29.948" end="0:30.269">事</span><span begin="0:30.269" end="0:31.311">中那</span><span begin="0:31.311" end="0:31.989">张书</span><span begin="0:31.989" end="0:32.624">签</span></p><p begin="0:32.624" end="0:37.586" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v4"><span begin="0:32.624" end="0:33.593">有一束</span><span begin="0:33.593" end="0:34.507">光</span> <span begin="0:35.452" end="0:36.542">将我照</span><span begin="0:36.542" end="0:37.586">亮</span></p><p begin="0:38.127" end="0:42.719" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v4"><span begin="0:38.127" end="0:38.686">当我</span><span begin="0:38.686" end="0:39.605">在没</span><span begin="0:39.605" end="0:40.085">人的</span><span begin="0:40.085" end="0:40.767">地方</span> <span begin="0:40.927" end="0:41.094">低</span><span begin="0:41.094" end="0:41.916">声歌</span><span begin="0:41.916" end="0:42.719">唱</span></p><p begin="0:43.676" end="0:49.547" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v5"><span begin="0:43.676" end="0:44.603">跌跌撞</span><span begin="0:44.603" end="0:45.480">撞</span> <span begin="0:46.526" end="0:46.845">去</span><span begin="0:46.845" end="0:47.036">向</span><span begin="0:47.036" end="0:47.365">远</span><span begin="0:47.365" end="0:48.135">方</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:45.062" end="0:49.547"><span begin="0:45.062" end="0:46.184">(跌跌撞</span><span begin="0:46.184" end="0:46.760">撞</span> <span begin="0:47.877" end="0:48.121">去</span><span begin="0:48.121" end="0:48.506">向</span><span begin="0:48.506" end="0:48.931">远</span><span begin="0:48.931" end="0:49.547">方)</span></span></p><p begin="0:49.276" end="0:52.740" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v6"><span begin="0:49.276" end="0:49.484">赤着</span><span begin="0:49.484" end="0:52.065">脚拼命奔跑 想要向世界证明我并不</span><span begin="0:52.065" end="0:52.386">渺</span><span begin="0:52.386" end="0:52.740">小</span></p><p begin="0:52.900" end="0:55.288" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v6"><span begin="0:52.900" end="0:53.620">谢谢你 用</span><span begin="0:53.620" end="0:53.966">微笑</span> <span begin="0:53.966" end="0:55.007">参与我这段年</span><span begin="0:55.007" end="0:55.288">少</span></p></div><div begin="0:55.517" end="1:11.738" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:55.517" end="0:57.476" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v7"><span begin="0:55.517" end="0:55.729">Ba</span><span begin="0:55.729" end="0:56.153">by</span> <span begin="0:56.153" end="0:56.367">I</span> <span begin="0:56.367" end="0:56.854">pro</span><span begin="0:56.854" end="0:56.975">mise</span> <span begin="0:57.183" end